---

<section class="safety section section--soft" id="safety">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="safety-header reveal">
      <h2 class="section-title-center">Know what you're agreeing to.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="safety-grid">
      <div class="safety-card reveal">
        <h3 class="safety-role">Sender</h3>
        <ul class="safety-list">
          <li>Declare contents accurately</li>
          <li>Provide accurate weight</li>
          <li>Send only permitted / non-dutiable items</li>
          <li>Pack and label correctly</li>
          <li>Accept customs risk disclosures</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="safety-card reveal" style="transition-delay: 80ms">
        <h3 class="safety-role">Passenger</h3>
        <ul class="safety-list">
          <li>Inspect the parcel</li>
          <li>Know what is in the parcel</li>
          <li>Do not accept unopened or suspicious items</li>
          <li>Understand that customs can hold the traveller responsible for baggage contents</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="safety-card reveal" style="transition-delay: 160ms">
        <h3 class="safety-role">Recipient</h3>
        <ul class="safety-list">
          <li>Recipient identity must match the delivery record</li>
          <li>May need to provide CNIC evidence at handover</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="safety-card safety-card--wide reveal" style="transition-delay: 240ms">
        <h3 class="safety-role">Everyone</h3>
        <ul class="safety-list safety-list--horizontal">
          <li>Use Khepia tracking</li>
          <li>Keep payment inside the approved flow</li>
          <li>Contact support if collection or delivery fails</li>
          <li>Use dispute mechanisms rather than side settlements</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Prohibited items link -->
    <div class="prohibited-link reveal">
      <p>Check what you can and cannot send before creating a parcel.</p>
      <a href="/prohibited-items" class="btn btn--secondary">View prohibited items</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .section-title-center {
    font-size: var(--text-h2);
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-10);
  }

  .safety-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-6);
    max-width: var(--container-wide);
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .safety-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }
  }

  .safety-card {
    padding: var(--space-6);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-soft);
  }

  .safety-card--wide {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
  }

  .safety-role {
    font-size: var(--text-card);
    font-weight: var(--weight-bold);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .safety-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: var(--leading-normal);
  }

  .safety-list li {
    padding-left: var(--space-5);
    position: relative;
  }

  .safety-list li::before {
    content: "→";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .safety-list--horizontal {
      flex-direction: row;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: var(--space-4) var(--space-8);
    }

    .safety-list--horizontal li {
      flex: 1 0 calc(50% - var(--space-8));
    }
  }

  .prohibited-link {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: var(--space-10);
  }

  .prohibited-link p {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }
</style>
